oof that Shorts are a views trap, not a revenue source. FactTechz's real money machine is long-form content.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Audience Demographics\n\n### Gender\n| Gender | % |\n|--------|---|\n| Male | 84.6% |\n| Female | 15.3% |\n\n### Age Distribution\n| Age Group | % |\n|-----------|---|\n| 13-17 | 0.5% |\n| 18-24 | 4.7% |\n| 25-34 | 12.0% |\n| 35-44 | 19.6% |\n| 45-54 | 19.3% |\n| 55-64 | 20.1% |\n| **65+** | **23.8%** |\n\n> **63.2% of viewers are 45+.** Similar age profile to Brain Station Advanced (64.5% 45+). Facts/science content attracts older, educated viewers with high purchasing power — this is why the RPM is \\$4.31 despite being a Hindi channel.\n\n### Top Countries\n| Country | % |\n|---------|---|\n| 🇺🇸 United States | **45.8%** |\n| 🇮🇳 India | 22.2% |\n| 🇬🇧 United Kingdom | 13.6% |\n| 🇨🇦 Canada | 9.5% |\n| 🇦🇺 Australia | 8.9% |\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **Tier 1 Traffic = 77.8%** (US+UK+CA+AU). **45.8% US traffic for a Hindi channel is extraordinary.** This is the Indian diaspora in America, UK, Canada, and Australia watching Hindi content. This is why the RPM is \\$4.31 — nearly at Western-channel levels — despite being primarily Hindi content.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Key Videos (From Screenshot)\n\n| Title | Views | Age |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| Call Without SIM! The Satellite ERA Has Begun! & Many Random Facts | **632K** | 1 year |\n| How India's MOST Dangerous Plane CRASH Happened & Many Facts | **2M** | 1 year |\n| TERRIFYING: Universe Might Collapse SOONER Than We Thought! | **1M** | 1 year |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Comparison — FactTechz vs All Analyzed Channels\n\n| Metric | Brain Station | Byte Sized | Stickman 616 | MARINARA | PsychToons | Cosmic Explainer | **FactTechz** |\n|--------|-------------|-----------|-------------|---------|-----------|-----------------|-------------|\n| **Niche** | Math | Tech | MCU | GTA Kids | Psychology | History | **Facts/Science** |\n| **Subs** | 460K | 183K | 21.1K | 109K | 81.3K | 20.1K | **21.5M** |\n| **Videos** | 319 | 24 | 32 | 162 | 110 | 19 | **~2,500** |\n| **Total Views** | 29.9M | 19.4M | 8.51M | 81.3M | 6.4M | 2.6M | **11.74B** |\n| **Long RPM** | \\$1.72 | \\$5.80 | \\$2.57 | \\$1.98 | \\$1.69 | \\$5.17 | **\\$4.31** |\n| **Monthly Rev** | \\$3,065 | \\$8,150 | \\$8,636 | \\$74,948 | \\$5,594 | \\$28 | **\\$389,785** |\n| **Per Year** | \\$37K | \\$98K | \\$104K | \\$900K | \\$67K | \\$336 | **\\$4.68M** |\n| **Lifetime** | ~\\$51K | ~\\$112K | ~\\$21.9K | ~\\$161K | ~\\$10.9K | ~\\$13.5K | **~\\$15-25M** |\n| **Rev/Video** | \\$161 | \\$4,678 | \\$270 | \\$463 | \\$99 | \\$712 | **~\\$6-10K** |\n| **Tier 1 %** | 70.3% | 72.3% | 80.2% | 77.2% | 75.2% | 79.5% | **77.8%** |\n\n> FactTechz is in a completely different league. It earns more **per month** (\\$389K) than most channels on this list have earned in their **entire lifetime**.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Key Insight\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> ### The Indian Diaspora Revenue Machine\n>\n> FactTechz proves that **Hindi content can earn at near-Western RPMs** if the audience is the Indian diaspora (NRIs in US/UK/Canada/Australia). Key factors:\n>\n> 1. **\\$4.31 RPM** — higher than most English channels we analyzed (Brain Station \\$1.72, PsychToons \\$1.69, MARINARA \\$1.98)\n> 2. **45.8% US traffic** — NRIs watching Hindi content pay American ad rates\n> 3. **287M monthly views** — absolutely massive reach\n> 4. **99% of revenue from long-form** — Shorts are a views magnet but revenue irrelevant\n> 5. **10 years of consistency** — 2,500 videos, built slowly from 2016\n>\n> **This is NOT replicable quickly.** This took a decade of daily Hindi content, a recognizable face, and a loyal NRI audience. But it proves that Hindi + diaspora targeting can be as profitable as English content.\n\n---\n\n## Data Sources\n\n| Data Point | NexLev Tool Used | Status |\n|-----------|-----------------|--------|\n| Channel profile | `youtube_channel_about` | ✅ |\n| RPM / Revenue / Demographics | `get_geography_revenue` | ✅ |\n","Description":"NexLev audit of @FactTechz - a 21.5M sub Hindi facts channel earning $389K/month with comparison to all previously analyzed channels.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\ef440df2-a098-44c4-b54d-aa1af299148e\\FactTechz_analysis.md","toolAction":"Creating audit report","toolSummary":"FactTechz analysis"}}]}
